// DeepPoker Strategy V2 | CASH6MAX v0.3.0 CONTEXT-REVIEW | self-contained OpenPPL
// Objective: CORRECTED LOGIC CANDIDATE, NOT APPROVED FOR PLAY, not a solver/GTO claim.
// Cash 6max with 100bb baseline; accepts other stacks with conservative branches.
// Source: professional published concepts + independent broad heuristic choices.
// Default.bot is never relied upon: each street has a final explicit action.
// Caution: respect poker platform rules; intended only where automation permitted.
// Root status: v0.1 contained systemic hand-ranking, pot-price and initiative errors.
// This revision addresses effective pot risk, hand strength tiers and conditional non-nut defense.

